---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<p class="page-cta">
  Using this framework for an architecture review or a target-state design? Start with the
  <a href={`${base}/proof/checklists/`}>review checklists</a>, open an
  <a href="https://github.com/sunilp/enterprise-data-architecture/issues">issue on GitHub</a>, or
  reach the author at <a href="mailto:sunil@sunilprakash.com">sunil@sunilprakash.com</a>.
</p>

<style>
  .page-cta {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: var(--body-2);
    color: var(--fg-light);
    background: var(--navy-wash);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--navy);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4);
    margin-top: var(--space-7);
  }

  .page-cta a {
    color: var(--fg);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: var(--navy);
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .page-cta a:hover { color: var(--navy); }
</style>
